ing_Is_Killing_the_Children_34F_Cover-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:120px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_34F_Cover.jpg\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 34F Cover.jpg (25 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:120px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/9/93/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_34F_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20250118060807\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 34F Cover.jpg (25 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Something Is Killing the Children #34, American Mask.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Something Is Killing the Children 34F Cover.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_34F_Cover.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"&lt;i&gt;Something Is Killing the Children&lt;/i&gt; #34, American Mask.\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 34F Cover.jpg (25 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Something Is Killing the Children #34, American Mask.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Something Is Killing the Children 34F Cover.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_34F_Cover.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"&lt;i&gt;Something Is Killing the Children&lt;/i&gt; #34, American Mask.\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/9/93/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_34F_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20250118060807\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #34, American Mask.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Somethi